        "at": "2026-11-23T17:10:09"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "WHY-STAKES",
      "narration_text": "That isn't only unfair, it's expensive. More than five thousand A D A lawsuits over websites and apps were filed in twenty twenty-five. And up to one in four American adults lives with a disability. These are real people being turned away.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "illustrate",
        "remotion": {
