    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "WHAT",
      "narration_text": "So the project is simple to say. Find the barriers. Fix the actual code. Prove each fix worked, with a person signing off before it ships. Small sites and open-source projects get a fix, instead of a lawsuit.",
