    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "act": "TOOLS",
      "narration_text": "Every tool has a permission policy written in code, not in the prompt. The scanner only visits allow-listed sites. The editor writes to a branch inside a sandbox, never to main. Opening a pull request needs a signed approval. And text on a web page is treated as data, never as instructions.",
