    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "act": "GATE",
      "narration_text": "The human gate. Before any pull request opens, a person sees the exact diff, before and after screenshots, and the re-scan result. They approve, refuse, or defer, and that decision is bound to a hash of what they saw. Change one line, and the approval no longer counts.",
